Subject: [PATCH 12/23] rusticc: KALIRU_TRIM_TEXT (resident code = working set
 after startup), api/status profile scopes; run script trims after 120 s

Measured on the CC1 idle: RSS 33.9 -> 30.7 MB, PSS 32.2 -> 28.9 MB (stock
COSMOS: 31.4 MB RSS + 4.1 MB swapped, PSS 30.1 MB).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
